# Mentalis AI Integration Environment Variables
# -----------------------------------------------------------
# Mentalis is an offline-first cognitive arithmetic platform.
# All arithmetic generation, scoring, diagnostic estimation,
# and daily personalized training plans work 100% locally
# and privately without an OpenAI API key.
#
# If you wish to enable the optional AI Coach for personalized
# pedagogical insight and plan narrative explanations:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local: cp .env.example .env.local
# 2. Add your official OpenAI API key below.
# 3. Never commit .env.local to version control.
# -----------------------------------------------------------

# Secure Server-Side OpenAI API Key (Never exposed to client bundles or browser code)
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Production OpenAI Model for Structured Outputs (Defaults to gpt-4o-mini if unspecified)
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
